OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK loses majority on West
OL,4,ANorthants Council
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK has lost its majority on West
OL,7,FNorthamptonshire Council.
OL,9,FThe party has suspended Nigel Berrill,
OL,10,Fwho represents the Kingsthorpe North
OL,11,Fward, pending an investigation.
OL,13,FReform is still the ruling group but
OL,14,Fnow has only half of the authority's 76
OL,15,Fcouncillors. A spokesperson for the
OL,16,Flocal authority confirmed it was now
OL,17,Funder No Overall Control.
OL,19,FBerrill has been contacted for comment.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
